---
title: "update_cache (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_id: has_same_price_identifier(update, price_info_object)
    q_check_id --> q_abort: false, abort E_UPDATE_AND_PRICE_INFO_OBJECT_MISMATCH
    q_check_id --> q_fresh: true
    q_fresh --> q_emit: is_fresh_update(update, price_info_object) == true
    q_fresh --> [*]: is_fresh_update == false (no-op)
    q_emit --> q_update: pyth_event::emit_price_feed_update(price_feed, timestamp)
    q_update --> [*]: price_info::update_price_info_object(price_info_object, update)

    note right of q_fresh
        INV-001: price identifier of update must match price_info_object
        INV-002: only strictly newer prices overwrite cached price (monotonic timestamps)
        INV-003: stale or equal-timestamp updates are silently ignored
    end note
